     *===============================================================*
    H/TITLE SR31305 - NY - Exclusion of Executive Officers Endorsement
     *===============================================================*
     * WC310305.B - New York Exclusion of Executive Officers Endorse *
     *                                                               *
     * Program Description:                                          *
     *                                                               *
     *   Determines if this endorsement form should be attached to   *
     *   the policy and creates data in the Endorsement Form         *
     *   Workfile (WXFMP) prior to a form merge.                     *
     *                                                               *
     * Created   : 05/09/01                                          *
     * Programmer: C:90                                              *
     * Project   : CM027                                             *
     *===============================================================*
     * REVISIONS:                                                    *
     *                                                               *
     * 10/19/22 C:342 Project: WC2834 (Recompile)                    *
     *                Endorsement Recognition of Cancellation        *
     *                                                               *
     * 05/30/01 C:90 Project: CM027                                  *
     *               Add add'l input program to WC310305.            *
     *                                                               *
     * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
     *  NOTE: Please add comments to the top of revisions.           *
     * ------------------------------------------------------------- *
     *===============================================================*
     * Notes:                                                        *
     *                                                               *
     *  Utilizes the endorsement copybook (SCOPYEN01F/I/C).          *
     *                                                               *
     *  QQMODE = 1 - Called to determine if form should be attached. *
     *  QQMODE = 2 - Called to print endorsement.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 3 - Called for additional input.                    *
     *  QQMODE = 4 - Called for mid-term processing.                 *
     *===============================================================*
     ** Copybook F specs
     F/COPY SCOPYEN01F
     *
     ** Additional Information File
     Fwxfmp1    if   e           k disk    usropn
     F                                     rename(pfm01:pfm02)
     *=========================================================================
     *  Definition Specs
     *=========================================================================

     D ix              s              2  0
     D x               s              2  0
     D xxnm            s             40

     ** Copybook D specs
     D/COPY SCOPYEN01D
     *=========================================================================
     *  /COPY required constants
     *=========================================================================
     ** Form ID
     D qqForm          s             15a   inz('WC310305B ')
     ** Additional entry program
     D addpgm          c                   const('SR31305I  ')

      *entry parameters
     D SR31305         PR
     D                                3
     D                                3
     D                                9
     D                                5
     D                                3
     D                                1
     D                                9  0
     D                                1
     D SR31305         PI
     D  qqCo#                         3
     D  qqFnd                         3
     D  qqEmp#                        9
     D  qqDiv                         5
     D  qqFyr                         3
     D  qqMode                        1
     D  qqRrn                         9  0
     D  qqMod2                        1
